      "hizbQuarter": 25,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 399,
      "text": "On the Day[51] some faces will turn bright while other faces will turn dark. As for those whose faces turn dark, [they will be told], “Did you disbelieve after having believed? Taste the punishment for your disbelief.”",
